Z||000000||Fierobruiser||11-14-2001||10:31 PM||||I'm looking for a source for aftermarket power steering for the Fiero. I've seen some mention of it on the forum. My wife can't manage my 85 and while my 88 is a lot lighter, there are a lot more 84-87's to be had out there.She'd like a Fiero but she really can't manage the steering at slow speed.<P>------------------<BR>Notchbacks Rule<BR>85GT(show car)<BR>88Coupe (daily driver)<BR>84 Coupe(project car)||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||11-15-2001||04:20 AM||||Have you tried removing the steering dampener?  That really lightens up the steering (and is a whole lot cheaper).  <P>There isn't anyone who makes a kit for a complete, bolt on P/S system for the Fiero.  GM was planning to add a hydroelectric unit to the '89s.   ||||reg||1
